======
RULES
======
(Basic Movement)
(cf increpare's kettle)
(4 direction sets: ur, ul, dr, dl)
(eventually more. need a better way of extending this.)
[up obj:dr] -> [obj:dr]
[left obj:dr] -> [obj:dr]

[up obj:dl] -> [obj:dl]
[right obj:dl] -> [obj:dl]

[down obj:ur] -> [obj:ur]
[left obj:ur] -> [obj:ur]

[down obj:ul] -> [obj:ul]
[right obj:ul] -> [obj:ul]


(Blockers)

[Blocker:Awake] -> [down Blocker:Awake] (this might move more than I want it to...)
[Blocker:Awake] -> [Blocker:Asleep]
[Player | Blocker:Asleep] -> [Player | Blocker:Awake]

(Turntables)
(I could force turntable to fling you off at the first free spot. Actually more interesting than what I had planned, so let's.)
( simpler turntable: activate by action )
[obj:ur Action Turntable:passive] -> [obj:ul Turntable:passive]
[obj:ul Action Turntable:passive] -> [obj:dl Turntable:passive]
[obj:dl Action Turntable:passive] -> [obj:dr Turntable:passive]
[obj:dr Action Turntable:passive] -> [obj:ur Turntable:passive]
( alternative turntable: always on.)
once [obj Turntable:active] -> [obj Activated Turntable:active]
[obj:ur Activated Turntable:active] -> [obj:ul Turntable:active]
[obj:ul Activated Turntable:active] -> [obj:dl Turntable:active]
[obj:dl Activated Turntable:active] -> [obj:dr Turntable:active]
[obj:dr Activated Turntable:active] -> [obj:ur Turntable:active]

